  link: 'https://www.inkdrop.app',
  name: 'inkdrop',
  description: 'Inkdrop is an AI-native Markdown note-taking app designed for developers, featuring end-to-end encrypted sync, MCP server integration, and rich customization.',
  introduction: '## Overview\n' +
    'Inkdrop is an AI-native Markdown note-taking application specifically crafted for developers. It provides a seamless context flow between developers and AI agents, backed by end-to-end encryption and cross-platform sync across macOS, Windows, Linux, iOS, and Android.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Key Features\n' +
    '- **AI Agent & Context Integration**: Features a built-in Model Context Protocol (MCP) server enabling AI clients (such as Claude Code) to search and read your context and notes.\n' +
    '- **AI-Ready Note Templates**: Pre-structured templates carrying instructions for AI agents to fill out bug write-ups, daily reports, and feature plans.\n' +
    '- **Developer-Centric Markdown Editor**: Supports slash commands, code-aware autocompletion, inline AI assistance, Next Edit Suggestions, and interactive text formatting.\n' +
    '- **Rich Tech Rendering**: Renders advanced code blocks with line numbers and file labels, interactive Mermaid diagrams, and KaTeX math equations.\n' +
