fetchItem, url: https://mindos.you mergedData: {
  link: 'https://mindos.you',
  name: 'mindos',
  description: 'MindOS is an open-source, local-first platform that connects AI agents to a shared knowledge base via MCP, enabling unified human-AI workflows.',
  introduction: '### Overview\n' +
    'MindOS is an open-source, local-first platform designed to create a shared cognitive layer between humans and AI agents. It serves as a unified context repository, ensuring that personal preferences, project guidelines, and operational SOPs are stored in local plain text and accessible to all connected AI tools.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Key Features\n' +
    '- **Global Mind Sync**: Built-in Model Context Protocol (MCP) server enables zero-configuration connection across diverse AI tools and agents (such as Cursor, Gemini, and custom bots).\n' +
    '- **Local-First & Transparent**: All project memories, SOPs, and user contexts are stored locally in plain text (Markdown/CSV), providing complete privacy, fast performance, and direct user editability.\n' +
    '- **Transparent Audit & Control**: Eliminates black-box memory by recording every retrieval, reflection, and action in local files, allowing humans to easily review and correct agent reasoning.\n' +
    '- **Cognitive Distillation**: Automatically captures ideas, structures execution paths, and updates knowledge bases so that past experiences continuously refine future AI behaviors.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Use Cases\n' +
    '- **Unified Agent Workflows**: Enable multiple AI agents to collaborate on coding, content drafting, and task planning without repeating context.\n' +
    '- **Knowledge Management**: Maintain single-source-of-truth project documentation and developer preferences across different IDEs and chat interfaces.\n' +
    '- **Automated SOP Execution**: Turn quick thoughts into executable tasks that agents follow according to predefined workflows.',
  categories: [ 'Developer Tools', 'AI Tools' ],
  tags: [ 'Open Source', 'AI', 'Coding', 'Productivity', 'Automation' ],
  image: undefined,
  icon: 'https://icons.duckduckgo.com/ip3/mindos.you.ico'
}
