fetchItem, url: https://moonbeam.network mergedData: {
  link: 'https://moonbeam.network',
  name: 'moonbeam',
  description: 'Moonbeam is a smart contract platform for building cross-chain connected applications, enabling seamless interaction across multiple blockchains.',
  introduction: '## Overview\n' +
    'Moonbeam is an Ethereum-compatible smart contract platform built on the Polkadot network. It allows developers to deploy existing Solidity smart contracts and Ethereum DApp frontends with minimal changes, while leveraging cross-chain interoperability to connect assets and services across 100+ blockchains.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Key Features\n' +
    '- **Full EVM Compatibility:** Supports standard Ethereum Web3 RPCs, accounts, keys, logs, subscriptions, and smart contracts written in Solidity or Vyper.\n' +
    '- **Cross-Chain Connected Applications:** Enables native cross-chain messaging and token transfers across Polkadot parachains and external blockchain networks.\n' +
    '- **Substrate-Based Architecture:** Built on Substrate to provide fast block times (~5s), low transaction fees, on-chain governance, and shared Polkadot security.\n' +
    '- **Rich Developer Tooling:** Compatible with popular Web3 development tools such as MetaMask, Hardhat, Remix, Truffle, and Ethers.js.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Target Applications & Use Cases\n' +
    '- **Cross-Chain DeFi:** Unified liquidity protocols and decentralized exchanges operating across multiple blockchain ecosystems.\n' +
    '- **Web3 Gaming:** Low-cost, fast-finality infrastructure for deploying on-chain gaming assets and logic.\n' +
    '- **Real World Assets (RWAs):** Secure and scalable contract environment for tokenizing and managing real-world assets.',
  categories: [ 'Developer Tools' ],
  tags: [ 'Tech', 'Coding', 'Open Source' ],
  image: 'https://cdn.sanity.io/images/76lym2dp/mb-production/d04207c9ca8b2e50a21f0845c79165a479e7a618-800x420.gif',
