fetchItem, url: https://productbot.ai mergedData: {
  link: 'https://productbot.ai',
  name: 'productbot',
  description: 'ProductBot is an AI-powered product intelligence platform that synthesizes customer feedback and competitive data to guide product roadmap decisions.',
  introduction: '## ProductBot Overview\n' +
    'ProductBot is an AI-powered product intelligence platform designed to serve as a continuous "Product Brain" for modern product teams. Founded in 2023 in Austin, Texas, ProductBot moves teams beyond intuition-based roadmap planning by aggregating and analyzing customer feedback, competitive intelligence, and market signals into actionable strategic recommendations.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Key Features\n' +
    '- **Customer Intelligence:** Aggregates and analyzes feedback from support tickets, sales calls, CRM notes, app reviews, and analytics to surface core customer needs.\n' +
    '- **Competitor Intelligence:** Continuously tracks competitor updates, news, funding, and leadership changes with intelligent alerting.\n' +
    '- **Strategy Intelligence:** Provides automated prioritization recommendations scored by customer demand, strategic value, and effort.\n' +
    '- **Knowledge Graph:** Maintains a persistent, queryable contextual graph connecting customer signals with product strategy.\n' +
    '- **Autonomous Web Agents:** Conducts continuous web research and competitive monitoring on behalf of the product team.\n' +
    '- **MCP-Native Integrations:** Supports real-time, bi-directional synchronization with over 15 data sources including Jira, Zendesk, Salesforce, PostHog, and Slack.\n' +
    '- **Enterprise Privacy & Security:** Offers end-to-end encryption, single-tenant deployment options (AWS/GCP/Azure), BYOK, and automated PII redaction.\n' +
    '\n' +
