    '- **Video-to-3D Motion Capture**: Converts single-camera video footage from webcams, smartphones, or standard cameras into 3D body, hand, and facial movement data.\n' +
    '- **Text-to-Motion Generation**: Generates editable 3D character motions and poses directly from plain-language text prompts.\n' +
    '- **Robotics & Embodied AI Workflows**: Produces human motion reference data for simulation, behavior prototyping, and imitation learning in humanoid robotics (e.g., Unitree G1 and H1 models).\n' +
    '- **Broad Pipeline Compatibility**: Supports direct export to formats such as FBX, BVH, BIP, C4D, VMD, and Mixamo for integration with Blender, Unreal Engine, Unity, Maya, 3ds Max, MotionBuilder, Cascadeur, and iClone.\n' +
    '- **Flexible Motion Controls**: Provides features for multi-subject capture, motion cleanup, frame-rate adjustment, and pose refinement.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Practical Applications\n' +
    '- **3D Animation & Previs**: Rapidly prototype character animations and storyboards without manual keyframing.\n' +
