  name: 'scite',
  description: 'scite is an AI-powered research platform that helps users discover and evaluate scientific papers through Smart Citations and contextual literature analysis.',
  introduction: '### Overview\n' +
    '\n' +
    '**scite** is an award-winning, AI-powered research platform designed to help students, researchers, and scientific professionals discover, evaluate, and understand academic literature more effectively. Unlike traditional citation indexes that only provide citation counts, scite utilizes deep learning algorithms to extract the context of citations and classify whether a citing paper supports, mentions, or contrasts the cited claim.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Key Features\n' +
    '\n' +
    '- **Smart Citations:** Displays the exact snippet of text where a paper is cited, providing context on how and why the work was referenced.\n' +
    '- **Citation Classification:** Automatically categorizes citations into supporting, contrasting, or mentioning context.\n' +
    '- **scite Assistant:** An AI research assistant that answers scientific questions backed by real, verifiable citations from peer-reviewed literature.\n' +
    '- **Reference Check:** Allows researchers and publishers to upload manuscripts to verify if cited studies have been retracted, corrected, or strongly contested.\n' +
    '- **Custom Dashboards:** Enables monitoring of citation trends and research impact across institutions, journals, or topics.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Use Cases\n' +
    '\n' +
    '- **Literature Review:** Accelerated synthesis of research topics with context-aware citation checking.\n' +
    '- **Fact Checking & Rigor:** Identification of published papers with contrasting findings or retractions before citing them.\n' +
    '- **Academic Writing:** Seamless integration into research workflows to ensure high accuracy and reliability of cited evidence.',
